 "doc": "Extraction spec for M2 unit S1: solc AST of Rollup.sol + L1MessageQueueWithGasPriceOracle.sol -> guarded-command facts. The 'model' sections declare the state vocabulary the machine is extracted into (types, state, defs scaffold, params, observers); the 'binding' sections map contract storage, oracle calls, header carriers and named rules onto that vocabulary. Transition semantics (guards, writes, reads) are computed from the AST, never copied from anywhere. The extractor never reads spec/M1/facts; comparison happens only in tests_m2.",
